  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The Yukon Biodiversity Database describes publications and research projects about the biology of the Yukon and the Beaufort Sea. The database includes all aspects of all living things except humans. It includes non-human palaeontology and the environmental impacts of human activities. Records in the database may describe publications or research projects that are about other subjects in addition to biology, as long as they contain a significant amount of information about biology."
